WEBVTT

00:00:06.147 --> 00:00:09.632
<v><b>Doctor:</b></v> When was it she last walked?

00:00:09.783 --> 00:00:11.294
<v><b>Gentlewoman:</b></v> For two nights together,

00:00:11.294 --> 00:00:16.559
I have seen her rise from her bed, throw her nightgown upon her, unlock her closet,

00:00:16.559 --> 00:00:23.254
take forth paper, fold it, write upon it, read it, afterwards seal it, and again return to bed;

00:00:23.254 --> 00:00:25.932
yet all this while in a most fast sleep.

00:00:25.933 --> 00:00:33.037
<v><b>Doctor:</b></v> Besides her walking and other actual performances, what, at any time,

00:00:33.037 --> 00:00:35.182
have you heard her say?

00:00:35.261 --> 00:00:37.638
<v><b>Gentlewoman:</b></v> That, which I will not report after her.

00:00:37.663 --> 00:00:41.020
<v><b>Doctor:</b></v> You may to me and ’tis most meet you should.

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:44.922
<v><b>Gentlewoman:</b></v> Neither to you, nor any one, having no witness to confirm my speech.

00:00:44.946 --> 00:00:55.432
Lo you, here she comes − this is her very guise, and, upon my life, fast asleep.

00:00:55.646 --> 00:00:57.603
Observe her and stand close.

00:00:57.635 --> 00:00:59.008
<v><b>Doctor:</b></v> How came she by that light?

00:00:59.008 --> 00:01:02.549
<v><b>Gentlewoman:</b></v> She has light by her, continually, ’tis her command.

00:01:12.866 --> 00:01:15.209
<v><b>Doctor:</b></v> You see her eyes are open.

00:01:15.264 --> 00:01:18.783
<v><b>Gentlewoman:</b></v> Aye, but their sense is shut.

00:01:27.284 --> 00:01:28.857
<v><b>Doctor:</b></v> What is it she does now?

00:01:28.897 --> 00:01:30.891
<v><b>Gentlewoman:</b></v> It is an accustomed action with her.

00:01:31.290 --> 00:01:35.053
<v><b>Lady Macbeth:</b></v> Yet here’s a spot.

00:01:41.783 --> 00:01:47.562
Out, damned spot − out, I say.

00:01:47.736 --> 00:01:59.412
One − two − why, then, ’tis time to do it − Hell is murky.

00:02:00.695 --> 00:02:06.222
Fie, my lord, fie, a soldier, and afeard?

00:02:07.319 --> 00:02:14.438
What need we fear who knows this, when none can call our power to account?

00:02:16.208 --> 00:02:22.003
Yet who would have thought the old man to have had so much blood in him?

00:02:22.407 --> 00:02:23.616
<v><b>Doctor:</b></v> Do you mark that?

00:02:29.105 --> 00:02:35.673
<v><b>Lady Macbeth:</b></v> The Thane of Fife had a wife

00:02:39.188 --> 00:02:40.505
− where is she now?

00:02:47.191 --> 00:02:55.785
What, will these hands ne’er be clean?

00:02:57.413 --> 00:03:03.450
No more o’ that, my lord, no more o’ that − you mar all with this starting.

00:03:03.484 --> 00:03:06.781
<v><b>Doctor:</b></v> Go to, go to: you have known what you should not.

00:03:06.780 --> 00:03:11.536
<v><b>Gentleman:</b></v> She has spoke what she should not, I am sure of that.

00:03:12.858 --> 00:03:15.416
<v><b>Lady Macbeth:</b></v> Here’s the smell of the blood still

00:03:18.895 --> 00:03:24.990
− all the perfumes of Arabia will not sweeten this little hand.

00:03:25.388 --> 00:03:28.223
Oh, oh, oh!

00:03:28.223 --> 00:03:32.729
<v><b>Doctor:</b></v> What a sigh is there. The heart is sorely charged.

00:03:32.754 --> 00:03:36.811
<v><b>Gentlewoman:</b></v> I would not have such a heart in my bosom, for the dignity of the whole body.

00:03:36.836 --> 00:03:41.021
<v><b>Doctor:</b></v> This disease is beyond my practice;

00:03:41.512 --> 00:03:46.670
yet I have known those which have walked in their sleep, who have died holily in their beds.

00:03:46.671 --> 00:03:53.192
<v><b>Lady Macbeth:</b></v> Wash your hands, put on your nightgown, look not so pale:

00:03:54.314 --> 00:03:59.175
I tell you yet again, Banquo’s buried;

00:04:02.610 --> 00:04:05.072
he cannot come out on’s grave.

00:04:05.648 --> 00:04:06.626
<v><b>Doctor:</b></v> Even so?

00:04:06.674 --> 00:04:10.868
<v><b>Lady Macbeth:</b></v> To bed, to bed − there’s knocking at the gate − come,

00:04:14.699 --> 00:04:15.326
come,

00:04:19.522 --> 00:04:20.220
come,

00:04:23.485 --> 00:04:23.961
come.

00:04:32.399 --> 00:04:42.258
Give me your hand. What’s done cannot be undone.

00:04:46.095 --> 00:04:46.651
To bed,

00:04:54.207 --> 00:04:54.739
to bed,

00:05:00.403 --> 00:05:01.400
to bed!

00:05:06.449 --> 00:05:14.505
<v><b>Doctor:</b></v> Foul whisperings are abroad. Unnatural deeds do breed unnatural troubles:

00:05:14.712 --> 00:05:21.268
infected minds to their deaf pillows will discharge their secrets.

00:05:21.450 --> 00:05:29.109
More needs she the divine than a physician − God, God forgive us all.

00:05:31.410 --> 00:05:37.721
Look after her, remove from her the means of all annoyance, and still keep eyes upon her.

00:05:37.746 --> 00:05:47.588
So, good night, my mind she has mated, and amazed my sight. I think, but dare not speak.

00:05:48.096 --> 00:05:50.000
<v><b>Gentlewoman:</b></v> Good night, good doctor.